{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778523501925,"sessionID":"ses_1e7bd56c1ffedVgorhENl9Po2E","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-8b0c6ac4d4fed449","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"__issue_context__.json"},"output":"<path>/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/__issue_context__.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"body\": \"### Mondo term\\n\\nNeurodevelopmental disorder with cerebellar atrophy and motor dysfunction\\n\\n### Synonyms\\n\\nGEMIN5-related neurodevelopmental disorders, GEMIN5 disorders\\n\\n### Synonym type\\n\\nexact\\n\\n### Additional comments\\n\\nA Research Group from a Center of Excellence are requesting to add this term as they are doing a natural history study. I asked for exact synonyms because we aim to have all the synonyms in the gene-related conditions. \\n  \\nNeurodevelopmental disorder with cerebellar atrophy and motor dysfunction (NEDCAM) is an autosomal recessive disorder characterized by global developmental delay with prominent motor abnormalities, mainly axial hypotonia, gait ataxia, and appendicular spasticity. Affected individuals have cognitive impairment and speech delay; brain imaging shows cerebellar atrophy. The severity is variable. [OMIM] Other symptoms described include early‐infantile developmental and epileptic encephalopathies (EIDEEs). [\\nhttps://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-021-22627-w   https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11109505/]\\n\\nThank you,  Gioconda Alyea\",\n3:   \"comments\": [],\n4:   \"title\": \"Request for new synonym [Add GEMIN5-related neurodevelopmental disorders and GEMIN5 disorders as new synonym for Neurodevelopmental disorder with cerebellar atrophy and motor dysfunction)ADD NAME HERE]\",\n5:   \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9862\"\n6: }\n\n(End of file - total 6 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"body\": \"### Mondo term\\n\\nNeurodevelopmental disorder with cerebellar atrophy and motor dysfunction\\n\\n### Synonyms\\n\\nGEMIN5-related neurodevelopmental disorders, GEMIN5 disorders\\n\\n### Synonym type\\n\\nexact\\n\\n### Additional comments\\n\\nA Research Group from a Center of Excellence are requesting to add this term as they are doing a natural history study. I asked for exact synonyms because we aim to have all the synonyms in the gene-related conditions. \\n  \\nNeurodevelopmental disorder with cerebellar atrophy and motor dysfunction (NEDCAM) is an autosomal recessive disorder characterized by global developmental delay with prominent motor abnormalities, mainly axial hypotonia, gait ataxia, and appendicular spasticity. Affected individuals have cognitive impairment and speech delay; brain imaging shows cerebellar atrophy. The severity is variable. [OMIM] Other symptoms described include early‐infantile developmental and epileptic encephalopathies (EIDEEs). [\\nhttps://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-021-22627-w   https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11109505/]\\n\\nThank you,  Gioconda Alyea\",\n  \"comments\": [],\n  \"title\": \"Request for new synonym [Add GEMIN5-related neurodevelopmental disorders and GEMIN5 disorders as new synonym for Neurodevelopmental disorder with cerebellar atrophy and motor dysfunction)ADD NAME HERE]\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9862\"\n}","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"__issue_context__.json","time":{"start":1778523501907,"end":1778523501923}},"id":"prt_e1842f07f0013NjK1OE05BmRCr","sessionID":"ses_1e7bd56c1ffedVgorhENl9Po2E","messageID":"msg_e1842aa29001cUfPcFUkhyZtd6"}}
